KEEFTALK OPEN SOURCE LICENSING FRAMEWORK
==============================================================================

Keeftalk is built on a fundamental philosophy:
Keeftalk is free to use, free to modify, free to fork, free to self-host, and
free from advertisements and tracking. Users never pay for application features.

This repository contains components governed under distinct OSI-approved open-source licenses:

1. KEEFTALK ANDROID APPLICATION (Subdirectory: `/app`, `/macrobenchmark`)
   Licensed under GNU General Public License v3.0 or later (GPL-3.0-or-later).
   See terms below under "SECTION A: GNU GENERAL PUBLIC LICENSE v3.0".

2. KEEFTALK BACKEND SERVICES & INFRASTRUCTURE (Subdirectory: `/supabase`)
   Licensed under GNU Affero General Public License v3.0 or later (AGPL-3.0-or-later).
   See terms below under "SECTION B: GNU AFFERO GENERAL PUBLIC LICENSE v3.0".

3. KEEFTALK DOCUMENTATION & ARCHITECTURE SPECIFICATIONS (Subdirectory: `/docs`, `*.md`)
   Licensed under Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International (CC BY-SA 4.0).

